-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DCC model train captures
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Captures of a PIKO SmartDecoder XP 5.1 (1.7.0) decoder.


Logic analyzer setup
--------------------

The logic analyzer used was a Pico2 (samplerate 1MHz) with an OpenRemise sniffer board (https://github.com/OpenRemise/Sniffer).

  Probe       DCC
  ------------------
  D2
  D3
  D4          P track
  D5          N track
  D6          BIDI


Captures
--------

  Capture                            Action
  -----------------------------------------------
  cv_access_long_form_verify_byte.sr Verify CV1=0
  cv_access_long_form_write_byte.sr  Write CV1=4